    "top_description": `<p><meta charset="utf-8"><span>Enzyme Wizard offers a revolutionary approach to cleaning with plant-based, enzyme-powered formulas designed for homes, commercial spaces and the hospitality industry. Experience the natural cleaning power of Enzyme Wizard. Browse the range today and discover a smarter, greener way to clean. <span class="collection-read-more"> Read more</span></p>`,
    "below_description": `<div dir="ltr" class="editor-paragraph"><meta charset="utf-8"><div class="editor-paragraph" dir="ltr"><span data-lexical-text="true">Unlike traditional chemical cleaners, Enzyme Wizard products break down grime and dirt at a molecular level, ensuring a deep clean without leaving harmful residues behind. The soap-free formulas prevent static build-up, reducing the attraction of dust and dirt for longer-lasting cleanliness.</span></div><div class="editor-paragraph" dir="ltr"><span data-lexical-text="true">As an industry leader in eco-friendly cleaning solutions, Enzyme Wizard prioritises sustainability without compromising on performance. With a unique multi-enzyme formula and pH-neutral composition, these cleaners are tough on stains yet safe for use around families, pets, and sensitive surfaces.</span></div><ul class="editor-list-ul"><li value="1" class="editor-listItem" dir="ltr"><strong class="editor-textBold" data-lexical-text="true">Soap-free cleaning</strong><span data-lexical-text="true"> – No residue, no static, no dirt attraction.</span></li><li value="2" class="editor-listItem" dir="ltr"><strong class="editor-textBold" data-lexical-text="true">Multi-enzyme formula</strong><span data-lexical-text="true"> – Targets multiple types of grime for superior cleaning.</span></li><li value="3" class="editor-listItem" dir="ltr"><strong class="editor-textBold" data-lexical-text="true">Plant-based &amp; pH neutral</strong><span data-lexical-text="true"> – Safe for your family and the environment.</span></li><li value="4" class="editor-listItem" dir="ltr"><strong class="editor-textBold" data-lexical-text="true">Eco-verified</strong><span data-lexical-text="true"> – Certified by Global Green Tag &amp; Sustainable Choice</span></li></ul></div>`,
