    "below_description": "<div class=\"landing-page-header-container col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg-9 col-xl-9\"><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"contenthead\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Statewide Appliance Spares have Australia’s biggest range of rangehood spare parts and accessories for leading brands <a href=\"https://www.statewideapp.com.au/chef/rangehoods\">Chef</a>, <a href=\"https://www.statewideapp.com.au/electrolux/rangehoods\">Electrolux</a>, <a href=\"https://www.statewideapp.com.au/fisher-paykel/rangehoods\">Fisher &amp; Paykel</a>, <a href=\"https://www.statewideapp.com.au/lg/rangehoods\">LG</a>, <a href=\"https://www.statewideapp.com.au/westinghouse/rangehoods\">Westinghouse</a> and many more.<br><br>We ensure our most popular rangehood parts are always in stock – including <a href=\"https://www.statewideapp.com.au/rangehood-filters\">filters</a>, <a href=\"https://www.statewideapp.com.au/rangehoods/globe-lamp\">globes</a> and <a href=\"https://www.statewideapp.com.au/rangehoods/switch-relay\">switches</a> with fast Australia wide delivery and competitive prices.<br><br>Statewide Appliance Spares are a market leader in the supply of appliance spare parts for over 40 years. Our dedicated customer service team can offer expert guidance and advice to make buying spare parts easier.</p></div>",
